ออออออออออออออออออออออออออต MISCELLANEOUS COMMANDS ฦอออออออออออออออออออออออออ

ESCAPE          Abort           Abort multi-commands and anything else
CTRL-E,F9       Execute         Execute the saved command macro
CTRL-L          Redraw          Clear and reprint the screen
CTRL-R          Re-print        Re-print the last message on the top line
0 thru 9        Multi           Prefix for executing a command numerous times
{               Macro           Start remembering list of commands
}               Macro           Stop remembering
:,F8            Multirest       Rest optional # of times (see OPTION)
;,F7            Multisearch     Search optional # of times (see OPTION)
